  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-23 (in session): \"for WI-hodin, all as you recommend.\" The recommendations as put to the owner, by point:\n1. An empty name slot is an ERROR; fix the ADR-0036 Ruling 1 table text that says it \"may be empty\".\n2. An emitted symbol with an empty name or path: no raise; the validator reports it.\n3. The wasm-bindgen module node's language slot \"wasm\" is ACCEPTED.\n4. The view_template labels (heex for every template language) and the \"manifest\" slots are to be FIXED, only if a v19 bump happens (it moves ids). The v19 bump itself is not yet ruled.\n5. \"@hg:route\" in a file no analyzer classifies keeps \"unknown\": LEAVE.\n6. message_dispatch stand-ins in a .svelte file stay \"javascript\": KEEP.\n7. The npm stand-in's empty path becomes <external> (WI-hulup), only if a v19 bump happens (it moves every npm stand-in's stable id).\nStatus moves to todo_soft: points 1-3 are to build now (no id moves); 4 and 7 wait on the v19 ruling; 5 and 6 are closed by the ruling."  # 66c0
